# Normalized line endings: the repository's committed blobs are LF; checkouts
# must be LF too, so Prettier's format gate (`format:check`) behaves
# identically in the authoritative checkout and in every fresh clone,
# regardless of the cloning machine's git autocrlf setting. Binary evidence
# (screenshots) is auto-detected and untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
